	(text "Following the layout from the ISOW1432 EVM User's Guide\nThe datasheet differs from the EVM, so followed EVM layout\nCapacitors are the same as the EVM BOM\nFrom the datasheet:\n    \"GND2 and GISOIN need be shorted direclty on PCB, or connected through a ferrite bead.\""
